    {
      "text": "Fig 19, 'Architecture based on supply chain design: decentralized management (option B)'. The DHSC architecture — shared services, data services, digital ecosystems, an interoperability layer of enabling components, and external systems — with its health supply chain information systems divided by level. At national level: forecasting and planning, procurement, supplier and contract management, transportation management, warehouse management and cold chain management. At district level: procurement, order management, inventory management and cold chain management. At facility level: dispensing.",
